description	"Inquisitor Tualon Yaluna

A calculated and defensive Inquisitor who excels at controlling the flow of combat.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% Faster Swings
- Inquisitor Lightsaber (Staff/Blue Style Saber)
-- Cannot Be Disarmed
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (3)
-- Deflect (2)
-- Saber Throw (3)
-- 45 Damage On Saber Throw

^5Force Powers:
- Mindtrick (2) ^3[CS2]
- Push (2)
- Pull (3)
- Sense (2)
- Jump (3)

^8Attributes:
- Light's Beacon
- Tracking Beacon
- 20% Faster Hacking
- Dexterity (1)
- Health Regen Capped at 35
- Stat Viewer
- Sense Immunity
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (2)

^3Abilities:
- Dexterity Roll ^3[CS3]"